<div class="prose">
  <p>
    I am a Software Engineer II at <a href="https://www.niural.com">Niural AI</a>, where I work with the payments team
    and also contribute to the platform and infrastructure of the product. Previously, I was a Software Engineer at <a href="https://esewa.com.np">eSewa</a>, Nepal’s first and largest digital payment platform, where I built backend
    services in a microservices architecture. Building and operating production financial systems, where failures are
    costly, is what made me care about building reliable software.
  </p>
  <p>
    I received my Bachelor of Engineering in Software Engineering from <a href="https://ncit.edu.np">Nepal College of Information Technology (NCIT)</a>, Pokhara University, after
    completing a diploma in Computer Engineering.
  </p>
  <p>
    Outside of work, I keep exploring new research and technologies, build projects, and share what I learn with
    the community. During my undergraduate studies at NCIT, I served as a <a href="https://githubcampus.expert/SatyaRajAwasth1/">GitHub Campus Expert</a>, founded and led the student
    community <a href="https://tekcommunity.ncit.edu.np">Nepal Tek Community (NTK)</a>, and was an active member of <a href="https://nosk.org.np">Nepal Open Source Klub (NOSK)</a>.
  </p>
